# Committed Haxe oracle build script (M4).
#
# Target: Neko (installed at /usr/bin/neko on the reference machine; HashLink is
# not installed, and the interpreter is also supported by the command in the
# README). The compiled module lands in the ignored repository target/ directory.
#
#   haxe build.hxml
#   neko ../../target/oracle.n --assets <assets> --out ../../target/conductor-candidates
-cp src
-main Main
-neko ../../target/oracle.n
